OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 29 JUL
OL,4,CEVENTS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1988FSue Lawley presents the Six
OL,7,Fo'Clock News for the final time. In
OL,8,Ffact, this would be Sue's final time
OL,9,Fpresenting a BBC TV news programme. She
OL,10,Fhad been a BBC news presenter for 4
OL,11,Fyears and 10 months.
OL,12,
OL,13,FSue was leaving BBC staff to go
OL,14,Ffreelance, after 18 years with the BBC.
OL,15,FShe ended her final Six o'Clock News as
OL,16,Ffollows:
OL,17,
OL,18,F"That's it from the Six o'Clock News
OL,19,Ffor this week. So it's goodnight from
OL,20,FNick and goodbye from me. Goodbye."
OL,21,
OL,22,
OL,23,Sppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
