OL,4,CEVENTS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1988FLaurie Mayer presents the One
OL,7,Fo'Clock News (BBC One) for the first
OL,8,Ftime.
OL,9,
OL,10,CG2022FJon Mitchell presents an ITV
OL,11,FYorkshire weather bulletin for the
OL,12,Ffinal time. He joined Yorkshire TV (as
OL,13,Fit was then known) in 1989 and
OL,14,Fpresented over 70,000 weather
OL,15,Fforecasts.
